RPG Character Manager
Project Description
RPG Character Manager is a simple text-based Python application that allows users to create and manage an RPG character.

Features
Create a character.
Choose between Warrior, Mage and Ranger.
Calculate HP, attack and defense.
Add items to inventory.
Remove items from inventory.
Calculate weapon bonuses.
Level up a character.
Display a character sheet.

Character Classes
The application includes three character classes:

Warrior
Mage
Ranger

Each class has different base statistics.

Project Structure
rpg_character_manager/
main.py
character.py
inventory.py
README.md

How to Run
Open the project folder in VS Code.
Open the terminal.
Run the following command:

   python main.py

